            "content": {
                "overview": "Welcome to the Chapter 'gegp1ps' (Geometric Transformations). This chapter introduces the fundamental concepts of geometric transformations, which are the processes that map one geometric figure to another in a plane. We will explore how shapes change their position, size, and orientation."
            }
        },
        "chapter_summary": {
