            "subject": "unknown",
            "provenance": {
                "type": "AI_GENERATED",
                "model": "Ollama Local (Mixed)",
                "run_id": "RUN_20260825_155307"
            },
            "content": "Welcome to the Geometry chapter for Class 7! This chapter is foundational, focusing on understanding geometric shapes, their properties, angles, lines, and basic geometric concepts like perimeter, area, and volume. We will start by learning different types of polygons (triangles, quadrilaterals, etc.) and their internal angles. A key part of this chapter is learning about parallel lines, transversals, and theorems that describe how these lines interact. We also cover concepts related to the classification of triangles and the properties of quadrilaterals. Understanding how to measure and calculate the perimeter and area of 2D shapes, and eventually introducing 3D shapes (like cubes and pyramids), is a major goal. The focus here is on developing a strong visual and conceptual understanding of space and geometry."
        },
